"No other member of Gorgon's species is known on Earth."
"Gorgon calls himself the last and least of them; their home lies dead beyond space and time."
"A predecessor accepted the blessing of the Devouring once a successor was chosen."
"Their chosen lived for The Purpose, work like purging infection or correcting imbalance."
"Their ways have disappeared."
"Gorgon refused the Devouring; his work now is revenge."
"They practiced magic in which power came only through sacrifice."
"Most could not control their power, so a chosen few acted as intermediaries."
"A chosen one was the village wishing well, granting needs that made a proper miracle."
"A successor drank the predecessor's blood, then ate the body in a death cave."
"After the feast, the predecessor's spirit guides the successor from within."
"The inherited gift is part instinct, part combined ancestral knowledge."
